  "name": "Thoreum V4 self-transfer balance doubling",
  "summary": "The THOREUM V4 implementation credited the recipient without debiting the sender when both were the same address, so transfer(self, balance) grew the caller's balance by the post-fee amount. The attacker's contract repeatedly doubled small purchased balances and sold the unbacked tokens into the THOREUM/WBNB BiSwap pair.",
